hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"82","[AI-translation] Usamah bin Zaid se riwayat hai: Ke Abu Bakr bin Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazm ne unhen khabar di ke Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) ne apni khilafat mein unhen likha: Mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba ke sadqe [zakat] ka nuskha, aur us ke zimmedaron ka nuskha likh bhejo, aur un ke nasab namon mein buland [wazeh] karo. Aur mujhe wo hadees likh bhejo jo tum ne mujhe Amrah se, Aishah se bayan ki. [Rawi ne] kaha: Usamah ne kaha: Main ne Abu Bakr se kaha: Aur un ki un se hadees kaisi hai? To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Amrah bint Abdur Rahman ne mujhe bayan kiya ke unhon ne Aishah ko kehte hue suna jab unhon ne dekha jo logon ne apne sadqon mein naya nikala hai. Unhon ne kaha: 'Ya Subhanallah! Ye kitna mushaabeh hai us se jo Allah Taala ne Apni Kitab mein farmaya: Aur unhon ne kaha: Jo in maweshiyon ke peton mein hai wo hamare mardon ke liye khaas hai aur hamari biwiyon par haram hai; aur agar [paida hone wala] murdar ho to wo sab us mein shareek hain [Al-An'am: 139].'"
